WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.670
Let's talk ANS.

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.590
Starting with, what the heck is it?

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:05.430
Simply put, it's an open standard

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:08.650
that helps verify AI agents
are who they claim to be.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:09.490
Let us explain.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:13.710
These days, we use AI like our personal
assistant and best friend.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.810
Hi, Claude.
AI agents also talk to each other.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.590
That makes our lives easy.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.430
AI agents can contact other AI agents

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:24.550
to transfer bank funds,
renew an insurance policy,

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:26.210
or schedule a doctor's appointment.

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:28.270
The possibilities are endless.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.290
But here's the rub.

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:33.530
How do you know that when your AI
talks to the airline,

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.810
it's actually talking to the airline?

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.850
See, an AI agent might be
pretending to be an airline.

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:43.270
And boom. Whoever's doing that
has your personal data.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.390
No bueno. The solution?

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:48.790
ANS. It stands for Agent Name Service.

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:53.230
Users don't need to know any of the
techy stuff about how ANS works.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.690
All you need to know is that ANS

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:59.110
helps verify that AI agents
are who they say they are.

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:01.910
Think of it like an ID card for AI.

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:06.030
So when your AI talks to the airline,
the bank, or the hospital,

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:10.290
you know it's really talking to the
airline, the bank, or the hospital.

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:11.890
And you can rest easy.

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:16.670
ANS helps keep the internet and agents
open and functioning smoothly.

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:20.310
It's designed to work with many of the
new and developing technologies

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:22.890
across the web,
so businesses can stay connected

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:25.110
as the internet continues to change.

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:29.350
Just as no one company owns the internet,
no one owns ANS.

00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:33.450
But it helps all of us.
Because, well, it just works.

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:36.830
Every day, AI becomes
a bigger part of our lives.

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:38.670
And it's more important than ever

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:42.550
to confirm that the AI agents you work
with are who they say they are.

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:45.910
ANS is one way you can
stay ahead and protect yourself.

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:47.310
All you'll have to worry about

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:50.750
is spending a little too much time
being besties with your AI.
